#* {{quote-journal|en|year=1921|journal=[[w:Kodaikanal Solar Observatory|Kodaikanal Observatory]] Bulletin|volume=III|location=New Delhi|publisher=Manager of Publications|page=173|pageurl=https://books.google.com/books?id=l4TnAAAAMAAJ&q=penumbr%C3%A6|oclc=499667801|passage=The velocities found in the '''penumbræ''' of spots generally increase with the distance from the centre of radiation, the motion being zero at some point in the umbra, and accelerating outwards.}}
